flowchart TD
Start([GET /GetLastMessages]) --> ReceiveCount[Отримати count параметр]
ReceiveCount --> ValidateCount{count > 0?}
ValidateCount -->|Ні| SetDefault[count = PAGE_SIZE default]
ValidateCount -->|Так| UseCount[Використати count]

SetDefault --> QueryDB
UseCount --> QueryDB[(Запит до БД)]

QueryDB --> GetUserLogin[Фільтр по UserLogin]
GetUserLogin --> FilterUnread[EventViewed = false]
FilterUnread --> OrderByTimestamp[ORDER BY Timestamp DESC]

OrderByTimestamp --> TakeCount[TAKE count]
TakeCount --> LoadData[Завантажити дані]

LoadData --> MapToNotificationDto[AutoMapper → NotificationDto]
MapToNotificationDto --> ReturnList[Повернути List NotificationDto]

ReturnList --> End([200 OK])

style QueryDB fill:#e1f5ff
style MapToNotificationDto fill:#fff4e1
style ReturnList fill:#e8f5e9
